OL,3,ATory activist in 'contract killing
OL,4,Abroker' claim had worked for party HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Tory activist who appeared to
OL,7,Foffer to "broker" the hiring of
OL,8,Fcontract killers in an undercover film
OL,9,Freport previously worked for
OL,10,FConservative headquarters.
OL,12,FJack Ross was contracted to do social
OL,13,Fmedia work for the party until earlier
OL,14,Fthis year, the BBC has been told.
OL,16,FIt comes after Conservative leader Kemi
OL,17,FBadenoch referred to them as "shocking
OL,18,Fallegations", adding that she did not
OL,19,F"believe that person is a member
OL,20,Fanymore".
