OL,3,ATory activist in 'contract killing
OL,4,Abroker' claim had worked for party HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Conservative spokesman said Ross's
OL,7,Fparty membership had "been suspended
OL,8,Fwith immediate effect pending an
OL,9,Finvestigation". It has reported that
OL,10,FRoss said his words were not meant to
OL,11,Fbe taken seriously.
